[{"id":177606841,"discussion_id":"c0c8c092626b2a01e685f3c7ce38c1c101ddb379","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234), [*陈风*](https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61) (2/2) | ✅ [*陈风*](https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61), [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n yourealize, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-29T11:47:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T09:22:27+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177607561,"discussion_id":"5e663c9632af7d7926cf8a57ab38942af0f658dd","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `scatter_nd_add` 确定性路径中 `QuantizeForSumVf` 与 `InverseQuantizeVf` 两个 SIMD VF 函数的 mask 计算错误。根因在于 `AscendC::MicroAPI::UpdateMask` 每次调用会消费（递减）`maskLen` 的值，原代码将 `maskLen` 作为函数参数直接传入，内层循环消费后导致外层行循环进入下一行时 `maskLen` 已变为 0 或残余值，使得仅第一行的量化/反量化正确，后续行全部出错。修复方式是将参数语义改为行无关的基准值，并在每行循环开始时重新初始化为局部变量 `maskLen`。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`QuantizeForSumVf` 参数重命名与 maskLen 重置**：将参数 `maskLen` 改为 `afterAxis`，并在外层行循环 `for (rowIdx ...)` 体内新增局部变量 `uint32_t maskLen = afterAxis;`，确保每行的 mask 长度从原始值重新开始。\n- **`InverseQuantizeVf` 参数重命名与 maskLen 重置**：将参数 `maskLen` 改为 `colLen`，并在外层行循环 `for (rowIdx ...)` 体内新增局部变量 `uint32_t maskLen = colLen;`，确保每行的 mask 长度从原始值重新开始。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T11:50:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T11:50:22+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177608717,"discussion_id":"90a5854e650135a041a4366b034503c2399432e4","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T11:54:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T11:54:17+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177620986,"discussion_id":"9312f1203547997587ed4fdd9640df866f1ae065","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:19:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T14:19:35+08:00","user":{"id":"684598ba4229be333029be60","login":"yourealize","object_id":"684598ba4229be333029be60","name":"陈展熹","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yourealize"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177621536,"discussion_id":"ee25c458ce36154f9c41fa576d4a411e6a9268f2","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=32099fb97f084316ba619f35654